"MicroG Maps turn arrows (#113 follow-up): when a notification comes from a package that reuses another app rules (rulesFrom, e.g. MicroG Maps app.morphe.android.apps.maps) and the icon drawable is not found under its own package name, retry the lookup under the root app package name (com.google.android.apps.maps) in the same package context, so icon-only cards show the right arrow. Ship as v0.0.79."
